5,1,1,talk,May,,Let's make this interesting! We need a real system so we aren't just guessing who's making the mess.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree. We should look at the actual state of the room and how it's being used.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Patience, my friends. Let us look at the hidden costs of our habits before we build a new path.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Sakura,,Ooh! A mystery! I want to know all the secrets of the break room! Let's find out everything!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I just want us to have a place where we can actually talk and be friends! Let's see what's happening!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,"@Kenji, that's sweet, but ""friendship"" doesn't clean the microwave. I want hard data on the chaos.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Misaki,,Data is useful. I'm interested in the physical environment and the noise levels.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Servas,,True harmony comes from understanding the burden we place on others. Time is our most precious resource.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Servas, you sound like a teacher! I bet there are funny things hidden in the fridge or the bins!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"Maybe the ""chaos"" is just because we don't talk enough? I want to know where the awkward stuff happens!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,May,,"@Sakura, you're a bad influence, but I like it. Let's see who's actually using the place the most.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"If we want a solution, we should check the facilities reports and the actual cleanliness.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Servas,,I shall look into the flow of labor. We must ensure no one is suffering in silence to keep us comfortable.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"I want to see the money stuff too! Like, how much are we spending on the outside people?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I'm going to check on the conversations! I want to know if we've been missing out on talking to each other!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,May,,"Alright, I've got my list. Let's see who's the real culprit of the break room mess!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I'll focus on the noise and the mess. It's the most practical approach.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Servas,,Let us proceed with an open heart and a keen eye for the truth.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Sakura,,Yay! I'm going to be a detective! I'll find all the clues!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I'm ready! Let's find a way to make this room a place where we can all be close!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
