35,2,1,talk,May,,"Well, it turns out a couple of people are basically camping in there while the rest of us barely get a seat.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Misaki,,The sound insulation is practically non-existent. We can hear everything from the desks.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Servas,,It seems we have been spending money and time on external spaces while our own internal balance is skewed.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Sakura,,Wow! We've been spending so much money on that other place! That's like a mountain of snacks!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"Guys, I found out something sad. We're barely talking to each other, and when we do, it's awkward because we have no privacy!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,May,,"@Kenji, that's because the room is a free-for-all. No wonder it's awkward; you never know who's going to walk in.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Misaki,,It's not just the privacy. People are eating at their desks now because the break room is too loud or messy.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Servas,,"When the environment is in turmoil, the spirit cannot rest. We must create a sanctuary, not just a utility.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Sakura,,But look at the prices for the new stuff! One is way more expensive than the other! Why is that?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"Exactly! If we just make it a ""kitchen"" or a ""lounge,"" we're still just strangers. We need a place for *us*.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,May,,"I'm not doing the cleaning for the ""campers."" If we make it a lounge, we need a strict schedule.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"A schedule won't fix the wall. If we keep it as a place for conversations, the office will be distracted.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Servas,,"Let us not focus on the rules, but on the value of the time we spend. Why pay others when we can invest in ourselves?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Sakura,,I think we should pick the one that saves us the most money in the long run! No more outside hire!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Misaki, maybe we can fix the wall? I just want a spot where we can say the hard things without everyone listening!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,May,,"I'm all for saving money, as long as it means I'm not the one scrubbing the table every Friday.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"Fixing the wall is an option, but we need to decide the primary purpose first.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Servas,,A space that serves the soul is always a better investment than one that merely serves the clock.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Sakura,,I'm voting for whatever stops us from paying that other place every month! It's a waste!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Kenji,,I'll support any plan that gives us a place to actually be friends and talk honestly!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
