60,3,1,talk,May,,"A calendar! Now we're talking. No more ""first come, first served"" chaos. I vote for the Meeting Space.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"The Quiet Room would solve the noise issue for the office, but it doesn't address the eating habits.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Servas,,A Meeting Space allows for the intentional gathering of minds. It respects everyone's time and purpose.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Sakura,,"If we make it a Meeting Space, we can just use it for the things we're paying for outside! Yay!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Kenji,,"A Meeting Space sounds too formal... but if it means we have a place to have those ""awkward"" talks privately, I'm in!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,May,,"@Kenji, just call it a ""Friendship Hub"" in your head. The point is the booking system.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"I'm concerned that if it's a Meeting Space, the eating will just move entirely to the desks, making the mess worse.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Servas,,"The mess is a symptom of a lack of intention. By giving the room a purpose, we give the people a reason to care.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Misaki, we can just have a ""snack time"" on the calendar! That way it's a party!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Kenji,,I love that! A place where we can actually plan to hang out and talk!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,May,,"See? Even the ""party"" people agree. The Meeting Space is the only one that stops the room-hogging.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Misaki,,"I suppose it's the most balanced option, provided we find a way to handle the food situation.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Servas,,Balance is the key to all longevity. Let us choose the path that invites collaboration over isolation.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Sakura,,I'm definitely voting for the Meeting Space! No more paying for that other room!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Kenji,,I'm voting for it too! Let's make it a place where we can actually get to know each other!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,May,,It's a landslide. I can already feel the relief of not having to argue about who got there first.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Misaki,,I'll agree. It's the most logical way to manage the noise and the usage.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Servas,,It is a joy to see a consensus born from a desire for mutual respect.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Sakura,,I can't wait to see the new table and screen! I hope we can watch funny videos on it!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Kenji,,"As long as we use it to talk to each other, I'm the happiest person here!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
